%% Why a contended atomic costs what it costs
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Invalid

  Invalid --> Exclusive: local read, no other sharer
  Invalid --> Shared: local read, line held elsewhere
  Invalid --> Modified: local write (read-for-ownership)

  Exclusive --> Modified: local write (silent, no bus traffic)
  Exclusive --> Shared: remote read
  Exclusive --> Invalid: remote read-for-ownership

  Shared --> Modified: local write (invalidate all sharers)
  Shared --> Invalid: remote read-for-ownership

  Modified --> Shared: remote read (writeback or forward)
  Modified --> Invalid: remote read-for-ownership (writeback)

  note right of Modified
    Coherence is per 64 B line, never per variable.
    Two unrelated counters in one line contend
    exactly as hard as one shared counter.
  end note
